    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d640">

                <pb facs="0767" n="679" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg679"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Neill to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Lima,
                            Peru</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-12-19"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">December 19, 1903</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 831.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor * * * to attach herewith a
                    copy and translation of a note from Doctor Pardo, in which he states that
                    according to an agreement between the minister of finance and the head of the
                    house of Messrs. W. R. Grace &amp; Co., an amount had been placed in the
                    projected general budget of the Republic for 1904 in order to pay the sum
                    claimed by the said house, and that diplomatic action was unnecessary.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Richard R. Neill.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d640-a1.xml" xpointer="d640-a1"/>
            </div>
